        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obuchesiyii khubayinda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhali murie, inywe abayinda; khalile nimukhupa tsimbungu khulwa amasila akali okhumwitsila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiobuyinda bieenywe biayoonoonekha, ebiifwalo bieenywe nabio amatsilili kabilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itsahaabu yeenywe neifeetsa yeenywe bieekhupa tsindebelende; tsindebelende tsiabio natsio tsilaba oburumbusi obumufukula; tsilalia emibili chieenywe shinga omulilo. Mweebiishila ebiobuyinda mundaalo tsiobumaliilishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, omushaara kwabakholi abamuchesela emikunda, okwa mwatinyakhwo munjila yoburana, omwoyo kwakwo kwayulanga; nalwo oluyoka lwa abo abachesa luhuliliishe mumarwi kOmwami wamahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwamenya eshiami mushibala, nimukhola aka mwenya, nimwinusia shinga tsing'ombe khulwa inyanga yobusinzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwamukhalachila eshiina omundu oubula eshikha, nimumwira; kata shiamukaya ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obwisimilisii nende okhusaaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho mwisimilisie, baana beefwe, okhuula khukhwitsa khwOmwami. Lole, omulimi alindiilila ebiamo ebikoosi bieliloba, nabiisimilisilia, okhuula olwa liba nilinyoolile ifula eyiranjilila nende eyihelelesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neenyu mwesi mwisimilisie murio; mwitinyie emioyo chieenywe; shichila okhwitsa khwOmwami khuli ahambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murabuuluulilananga abeene khubeene ta, baana beefwe, mbu muleshe okhuyaasibwa; lole, omuyaasii mwene usinjiile mumuliango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana beefwe, muhenje obusaalili nobwisimilisii bwabanabii ababoolanga muliira liOmwami, bube eshilolelo khwinywe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lole, khubalanganga mbu nabeikhabi abo abeefwila; mwahulila akobwifwili bwaAyubu, khandi mwalola aka Omwami yamala namukholela; shinga Omwami olwa yeetsuulemwo eshisa nende tsimbabasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne okhushila akandi kosi, baana beefwe, mureetsubanga ta; kata khwikulu, kata khushibala, kata khushiitsubo shindi shiosi tawe; nebutswa Ee yeenywe yibe Ee toto; kata Tawe yeenywe yibe Tawe toto; eshiina shileshe okhumufwila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliho mwinywe ousaalila? Asaaye. Aliho ousangaala? Yeembe akobwitsoomii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliho mwinywe oulwala? Alanje abakofu beikanisa; nabo bamusaayile, nibamutsushiililakhwo amafura muliira liOmwami; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne lisaayo liobusuubili lilamuhonia omulwale, Omwami naye alamubuusia; ne naba nali niyoonoona, alabileshelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwiyamilanenje ebionoono bieenywe, nimusaayilana, mbu muhonibwe. Okhusaaya khwomundu omulunjishi khuli nobunyali muno mukhukhola khwakhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya yali omundu woburulanda shingana obweefwe; yasaaya muno mbu ifula yileshe okhukwa; nayo niyirakwakhwo khushibala ta, emiyika chitaru nemiesi chisasaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana khandi nasaaya; likulu nilikwisia ifula, eshibala nishirusia ebiamo biashio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana beefwe, oundi yesi khwinywe naba nashiama niyeebera khubwatoto, oundi naye namukalusia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JAS 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mumanye likhuwa lino, mbu oukalusia omwonooni arule mubushiamu bweinjilaye, amuhonia omwoyokwe mukhufwa, nafuunikha ebionoono ebinji muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JAS.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JAS.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
